[{"title":"醉归","author":"谢晋","text":"有客招暮饮，值我出未归。\n扫门俟良久，剪烛频光辉。\n宾朋时在席，童子还开扉。\n跫然屐声至，接引褰重帏。\n相见即欢悦，满座生春晖。\n汎饮不计筹，欲起屡牵衣。\n入门已三鼓，银汉星斗稀。\n邻鸡鸣喔喔，朝马去騑騑。\n宿酲未能解，旦气存几希。\n醒醉日复日，世事竟相违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6839,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘孟功竹深处二十韵","author":"谢晋","text":"高人留客处，万顷绿云中。\n清閟浑无暑，凉阴不待风。\n交枝迷翡翠，接叶隐房栊。\n俗地无尘到，仙坛有路通。\n影筛金琐碎，声杂佩丁东。\n栖宿看仪凤，翱翔下颢穹。\n楚云朝晻冉，湘月夜空濛。\n林暗容春鸟，庭寒避夏虫。\n萧骚依枕簟，音韵合丝桐。\n酒或眠看醒，愁同对坐空。\n粉痕销旧箨，雨色翳新丛。\n裁笛从江叟，为竿任钓童。\n屐粘苔径碧，窗映露灯红。\n借看随人兴，何须问主翁。\n还持苍玉杖，来扣水晶宫。\n溪逸情偏遇，林贤趣未穷。\n虚心君子并，劲节古人同。\n几见凌霜雪，孤高倚华嵩。\n淇园秋渐晚，吴苑岁将终。\n宜隐筼筜谷，深藏造化功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6840,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题苏性初秋林学舍","author":"谢晋","text":"金飙初动蝉鸣歇，雨过轻凉散清樾。\n佳士研精不下帷，惊见素商隃八月。\n林疏几净绝纤埃，长日书声隔崦来。\n朱露滴残枫叶老，芸香过尽桂花开。\n人生等闲驹过隙，羡子青年勤努力。\n夜窗灯火喜相亲，平砌分阴知更惜。\n嗟余废弛竟无谋，笔砚荒芜几度秋。\n年光逝水追何及，时向西风叹白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6841,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"深冬","author":"谢晋","text":"深巷家家雪，萧斋处处风。\n年华看渐老，诗兴转无穷。\n更约寻梅伴，还依曝背翁。\n艰难经历遍，不觉尚飘蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6842,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜","author":"谢晋","text":"落日下平原，幽斋向昏黑。\n朔风四座来，寒月澹无色。\n青灯辉耿耿，形影在空壁。\n时方畏严凝，兀坐起未得。\n家僮侍其傍，为我长太息。\n入厨具杯酒，园蔬夜挑摘。\n殷勤置几前，相劝饮涓滴。\n徘徊酌且尽，尘虑俱荡涤。\n长吟复高歌，时将唾壶击。\n焉知醉渐醒，转复动愁戚。\n念彼故园中，儿女在家室。\n寒更拥地炉，斯时正岑寂。\n相思不相见，今夕复何夕。\n起望牛女星，迢迢河汉隔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6843,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈克全鹤沙八咏 其一 海岳晴岚有招鹤楼","author":"谢晋","text":"海日空濛里，仙山缥渺间。\n楼前人指点，岚际鹤飞还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6844,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈克全鹤沙八咏 其二 虹桥夜月","author":"谢晋","text":"静夜往来绝，垂虹跨秋水。\n两岸绿杨中，人家明月里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6845,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈克全鹤沙八咏 其三 潮音晚钟","author":"谢晋","text":"声动霜飞华，声沈月低影。\n客舟将梦回，闻时发深省。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6846,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈克全鹤沙八咏 其四 咸塘晚棹","author":"谢晋","text":"寒塘潮渐满，暮艇赴潮归。\n人语烟中集，鸟惊树上飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6847,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈克全鹤沙八咏 其五 东庄春雨","author":"谢晋","text":"春雨濡膏泽，东庄足一犁。\n农歌听渐窅，烟树望中迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6848,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈克全鹤沙八咏 其六 西湾夕照","author":"谢晋","text":"闪闪落霞边，飞惊去两两。\n返景入西湾，复照凄罾上。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6849,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈克全鹤沙八咏 其七 翟公故园","author":"谢晋","text":"翟公有故园，客散罢歌舞。\n不知翟公先，此地曾榛莽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6850,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈克全鹤沙八咏 其八 彭仙闲室","author":"谢晋","text":"彭仙乘鹤去，闲室閟松阴。\n明月自来照，白云闲到今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6851,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"还家","author":"谢晋","text":"旧业山塘半，萧萧屋数椽。\n琴书总零落，风景只依然。\n高树残阳里，青山暮雨边。\n归来秋尚早，随处嫩凉天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6852,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登天平山白云亭","author":"谢晋","text":"白云泉上白云亭，京国归来喜重登。\n欲试座间谁老健，酒酣先上最高层。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6853,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏兰","author":"谢晋","text":"只合度琴成雅操，不须纫佩惹清风。\n若非岁晚幽香在，何异蓬莱隐谷中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6854,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"谢晋","text":"梦醒虚堂月半斜，毵毵凉影拂窗纱。\n恍疑人曳青鸾尾，来向閒庭扫落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6855,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甘露瑞应诗","author":"谢晋","text":"銮舆晓出都门外，狩猎平原为观稼。\n千村鸡犬寂无声，万骑经过肃严戒。\n维时孟冬若春深，和气融融满空界。\n乃知德泽符天心，酿此甘液垂沆瀣。\n纷纷点缀松柏间，灿若明珠照回驾。\n叶上迎风色愈坚，林间映日光相射。\n赐时顿减词臣渴，尝处即起吾氓赊。\n小人何幸睹清平，献纳遥临玉墀拜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6856,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠中书舍人朱孔昜","author":"谢晋","text":"天上新承雨露浓，声名籍籍冠群公。\n沥心翰墨钟王继，适意丹青顾陆同。\n朝后归来应有兴，闲边挥洒想无穷。\n欲持布鼓雷门去，常恐云深路未通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6857,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿金秀才铉母八十","author":"谢晋","text":"铉也慈亲寿且康，鬖鬖垂白在高堂。\n每逢初度中秋近，况是今年八十强。\n亲友欢趋同预席，儿孙拜舞各称觞。\n云中冉冉来王母，持赐蟠桃一颗尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6858,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题周士原所索余画","author":"谢晋","text":"邈得林泉趣，清幽思不繁。\n烟霞渺无际，竹树自成村。\n地接王猷宅，湖当贺监门。\n山腰云锁断，涧口雨冲浑。\n境胜民居僻，年丰俗尚敦。\n书声来杏坞，渔唱起桃源。\n社散田家晚，钟鸣野寺昏。\n濡豪还自适，得句共谁论。\n展玩添新墨，沈吟想故园。\n他年从隐遁，此景可攀援。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6859,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逢偶先生武孟","author":"谢晋","text":"家住吴门便识荆，一时倾盖若生平。\n每怜远别知何处，谁料相逢却在京。\n厕迹忝为前辈友，论交已近十年情。\n还思虎阜寻僧路，松下曾陪杖屦行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6860,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中次偶武翁韵","author":"谢晋","text":"顷刻交衢积尺馀，翻翻缟带远随车。\n寒侵纸帐春云薄，光映灯窗夜色虚。\n望断人来那有棹，欲寻梅去恐无驴。\n闭门僵卧几三日，枕冷床头一本书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6861,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄沈徵士壁客窗卧病","author":"谢晋","text":"怜君卧病值除冬，一榻翛然旅寓中。\n枕畔香缄新药裹，壁间吟满旧诗筒。\n寒惊晓砌霜华白，暖爱晴窗日色红。\n拟待明朝扶杖起，探梅同步石城东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6862,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中喜周助教洽金正字问张校书誉同访","author":"谢晋","text":"羁人兀坐空斋晓，雪花扑帘正缭绕。\n忽惊骑从隘荆扉，恍若群仙下蓬岛。\n入门和气盎如春，满座寒威顿除埽。\n相延茗话故迟迟，旋置杯盘陈草草。\n举酒高歌白苧辞，未醉情怀即倾倒。\n却笑舟中王子猷，不见山阴戴安道。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6863,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜龚审言见访","author":"谢晋","text":"吴下龚高士，新从故里来。\n入门丰采旧，怜我鬓毛衰。\n共坐论书画，相延置酒杯。\n萧斋看日莫，不得更徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6864,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京华","author":"谢晋","text":"京华㞐九载，生计只依初。\n诗与年俱老，情于世共疏。\n无聊还对酒，健忘亦观书。\n欲把儒冠弃，他谋恐不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6865,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送马孝廉敬函骨归?","author":"谢晋","text":"岁月如流水，蹉跎鬓渐霜。\n全家来上国，七载值三丧。\n白玉函归日，青山是故乡。\n双亲正丘首，孝义有辉光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6866,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长至","author":"谢晋","text":"喜见微阳复，浑忘半点愁。\n日光浮客座，和气蔼神州。\n宾友慵迎送，儿童任去留。\n天时与人事，催促未能休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6867,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨","author":"谢晋","text":"骨月辞来久，天涯各一方。\n客边难听雨，枕上易思乡。\n多病惊寒早，无眠觉夜长。\n明朝如览镜，知自鬓添霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6868,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄太学生苏复省亲未至","author":"谢晋","text":"雪晴时节送君归，今见都门雪又飞。\n别去岂无书系雁，相思空有泪沾衣。\n只知近日丹青遍，宜念经年故旧违。\n肄业终当还胄监，孝心莫久恋庭帏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6869,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得家书","author":"谢晋","text":"有子居吴地，无书到凤台。\n近因讴棹便，脩得一封来。\n读罢愁还喜，閒时卷复开。\n为言丘陇上，松柏重新栽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6870,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归迟","author":"谢晋","text":"出山容易入山迟，落尽松花与桂枝。\n为爱夕阳成立久，不关逢客话多时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6871,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金正字白云坞藏亲图","author":"谢晋","text":"峨峨丘陇白云深，郁郁松楸结昼阴。\n拜埽惟兄兄更殁，展图官舍倍伤心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6872,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀刘德清","author":"谢晋","text":"远别诚何易，重期信觉难。\n相思万里外，兀坐一灯残。\n梁苑梅空老，官河雁独寒。\n间关头渐白，犹自恋儒冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6873,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中访金隐士铉","author":"谢晋","text":"雪中携策短，林下访幽居。\n篱犬先迎客，门生罢读书。\n笑谈虽自惬，怀抱为君舒。\n坐久清如许，归来兴有馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6874,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倦夜","author":"谢晋","text":"客边将岁暮，雨雪暗荒郊。\n夜冷衾成铁，风狂屋卷茅。\n愁肠萦九曲，漏鼓听三敲。\n自念身多病，经年绝故交。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6875,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪次韵","author":"谢晋","text":"冰蛾乱扑纸窗鸣，冻得银壶断漏声。\n静拥地垆添炭坐，不知天女散花轻。\n他年须鬓应争皓，此夜襟怀愈觉清。\n故友耐寒多逸兴，远缄珠玉慰羁情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6876,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江雨轩为偶武翁赋","author":"谢晋","text":"云脚四檐垂，风涛隔幔帷。\n轩中人睡起，江上雨来时。\n淅沥篷偏响，纵横苇乱欹。\n渚鸥轻喜浴，汀树远含滋。\n南浦深三尺，东皋足一犁。\n桑鸠昏逐妇，秧马绿生漪。\n已断黄梅候，将临白露期。\n樯柖应被泽，絺绤恐相疑。\n润独琴书觉，凉先枕簟知。\n榜歌听渐杳，征棹去何迟。\n渺渺沧洲趣，溟溟湖海思。\n拟将蓑笠去，剪烛夜谈诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6877,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送韩伯承还吴","author":"谢晋","text":"今朝佳节是花朝，相送重来白下桥。\n老语生憎莺舌巧，新愁翻压柳眉娇。\n天街有雨尘还少，酒巷无风旆自摇。\n咫尺清明归未及，羡君先上木兰桡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6878,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题芭蕉仕女图","author":"谢晋","text":"蕉绿映纤裳，沉吟对夕阳。\n妾心无改易，团扇又炎凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6879,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题狎鸥图","author":"谢晋","text":"我生岂有狎鸥方，鸥自飞来狎我旁。\n闲倚沧浪歌一曲，淡然鸥我两相忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6880,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日郊行有感","author":"谢晋","text":"凤台南下少平田，旧冢新坟远近连。\n但见清明来拜埽，那知岁月暗推迁。\n苔侵翁仲寒犹立，草没骐驎煖尚眠。\n无限客魂招不得，东风落日怨啼鹃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6881,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题顾静像次王孟端韵","author":"谢晋","text":"秋兰为佩葛为巾，笑里吟边总是春。\n莫道似翁閒个少，有閒未会作閒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6882,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题仙山图","author":"谢晋","text":"路转仙源无尽头，花飞红雨暗溪流。\n松根白石春犹卧，洞口残棋晓未收。\n杖履逍遥来羽客，烟霞缥渺出璚楼。\n谁怜涧底芝空老，月满商山几度秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6883,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送监生毛彦高归省","author":"谢晋","text":"研精胄监岁华深，归省庭闱遂孝心。\n蘋沼香生芹正绿，石坛花落杏成阴。\n停桡易尽频倾酒，执手难分欲去襟。\n想到高堂称寿日，春风帘幕昼沈沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6884,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送监生冯伯祯归省","author":"谢晋","text":"柳暗都门絮正飞，客舟今日先春归。\n傍人啼鸟听来歇，漂渚残花坐见稀。\n别去暂离司业席，到时重看老莱衣。\n明朝堂上供甘旨，入馔江鱼笋共肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6885,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重送二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"共向江亭把酒卮，酒酣还复共题诗。\n故人归省欢无极，他日重来会有期。\n亲舍白云看渐近，行舟绿水去何迟。\n依依霁女门前柳，知见君还定展眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6886,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重送二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"胄子今朝归省日，斑衣近喜沐恩波。\n云开京口山如画，风定江心镜自磨。\n歌罢骊驹乡思杳，倾残醽醁醉颜酡。\n到家莫讶春将尽，惟此馀春想更多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6887,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪张誉访赵山居","author":"谢晋","text":"暇日偶陪仙侣棹，深春远访隐君家。\n衡门寂静风尘少，座榻清幽兴趣加。\n林下烹葵尝旧酒，山中斲笋煮新茶。\n阿戎情厚忘归去，醉卧山窗月色斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6888,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得虎丘送别二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"天上楼台海上山，何年移却在人间。\n不因此地多清胜，那得游人数往还。\n望处已添吟咏兴，到时顿解别离颜。\n今朝送客同春去，门外白云千顷闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6889,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得虎丘送别二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"相送瀛洲客，来登海涌峰。\n岩云腾白虎，池剑跃苍龙。\n境胜诗情惬，杯深别思浓。\n匆匆分袂处，高塔夕阳舂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6890,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"久客还家白发新，龙钟赢得是间身。\n今朝偶向溪边坐，惟有青山识旧人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6891,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"天净波澄暑雨收，苍松影落钓鱼舟。\n青山本是闲边友，不独忘机有社鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6892,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其三","author":"谢晋","text":"解后寻诗作胜游，翠微深处山亭幽。\n鸟啼花落春将去，惟见寒泉石上流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6893,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其四","author":"谢晋","text":"碧树阴阴带翠湾，板桥南下草亭闲。\n谁知梅雨初晴后，便有人来坐看山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6894,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其五","author":"谢晋","text":"树林阴翳疑无日，泉石清寒不待风。\n露顶脱巾消散处，坐忘人世在炉中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6895,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其六","author":"谢晋","text":"青葱树隐赤阑桥，浦溆人家望望遥。\n开过桃花春浪暖，闲看翡翠戏兰苕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6896,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其七","author":"谢晋","text":"村村昏黑树阴浓，只尺湖塘路不通。\n夜半风来吹散雨，棹歌依旧月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6897,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柱琼草堂遗意卷二首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"旧业成都万里桥，百花潭北草堂遥。\n门无县吏催租税，座有邻翁慰寂寥。\n松影满庭闲白日，茶烟绕榻飏清飙。\n酷怜杜甫成诗史，翻笑扬雄作解嘲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6898,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柱琼草堂遗意卷二首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"草堂遗趾在，重搆剪荒榛。\n松偃吴门月，花移蜀地春。\n流芳知有本，继业岂无人。\n喜到琼枝茂，诗宗又一新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6899,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题避暑图","author":"谢晋","text":"岩前碧树映楼台，槛外芙蕖午昼开。\n不信清虚无暑到，直疑高处有风来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6900,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得龙门送范原绍应聘","author":"谢晋","text":"凌云峭壁耸崔巍，不待神功禹凿开。\n一径直通天上路，双崖隔断世间埃。\n虽无锁钥常关闭，肯放豺狼恣往来。\n今日送君腾跃起，从龙为雨润枯荄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6901,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天池访恺上人不遇","author":"谢晋","text":"山中夏将半，嘉树敷阴重。\n闲携绿玉杖，拄到青莲峰。\n苔径少行客，惟有旧游踪。\n临池涤烦襟，万壑来松风。\n兰若倚天间，岧峣白云封。\n高轩敞岩穴，疏棂衔翠浓。\n未缘释子共，所欣良友同。\n明当发毫素，赘言贻恺公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6902,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青来轩为范原绍赋","author":"谢晋","text":"青嶂排双闼，巍然南竹扉。\n晴岚凝客座，凉翠袭人衣。\n月为鸣琴出，云当卷幔归。\n还思郡斋里，曾对谢玄晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6903,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠致仕徐乐馀","author":"谢晋","text":"白头太守文章伯，晚节桑榆景倍饶。\n莫道户庭常不出，时还送客到溪桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6904,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]